ency-Files\" target=\"_blank\">This is the book</a>! Darker Days released their conversion before the Favored Attribute thing was revealed, but I think I say in Devoted to just use parent clan anyway.<br /> <br /> falco1029 has some plans for the Geiheim. I <i>think </i>he's taking a blood sorcery route, though not specifically Kimiya, like the Azerkatil.<br /> <br /> Just for fun, here's my current list for <b>Bloodlines: The Ageless</b>. Some of these will get meatier updates than others, and I reserve the right to cut one or two if we already did a quick conversion. You'll notice some of these got short updates in Resurrected, but I wanted to revisit some of them now that some time has passed. There's also material from Clanbook Mekhet I want to update, but that's for another discussion...<br /> <br /> \u2022 Brothers of Ypres<br /> \u2022 Sta-Au<br /> \u2022 Amara Havana<br /> \u2022 Geheim<br /> \u2022 Corajoso<br /> \u2022 Adroanzi<br /> \u2022 Mayarap<br /> \u2022 Mystikoi<br /> \u2022 Order of Sir Martin<br /> \u2022 Iltani<br /> \u2022 En<br /> \u2022 Usiri<br /> \u2022 Duchagne<br /> \u2022 Noctuku<br /> \u2022 California Xiao<br /> \u2022 Erszebet (possibly; I wasn't hugely satisfied with my quick update, and they're so iconic)<br /> \u2022 Anvari<br /> \u2022 Qedeshah<br /> \u2022 Children of Judas<br /> \u2022 Gulikan<br /> \u2022 Kuufukuji<br /> \u2022 Malocusians<br /> \u2022 Malkavians/Malkavia<br /> \u2022 Mnemosyne<br /> \u2022 Norvegi<br /> \u2022 Csalad<br /> \u2022 Caporetti<br /> \u2022 Shepherds<br /> \u2022 Canda Bhanu<br /> \u2022 Kinnaree.<br /> \u2022 Les Gens Libres<br /> \u2022 Bak-Ra<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodline