rom Belial\u2019s Brood<br /> \u2022 Tismanu (Mekhet), from Ordo Dracul<br /> \u2022 Vedma (Gangrel), from Ordo Dracul<br /> \u2022 Dunia (Akhud), mentioned in VII<br /> <br /> The Gethsemani are also tied into the Mortifiers write-up. There are about 40~ paragraph-long updates of other bloodlines that don't have proprietary Disciplines. There are also ten more full updates (and yet more quick ones) in Bloodlines: The Resurrected.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-16T17:45:01-07:00","id":1375186,"title":"","content":"Darn no Galloi. Ah well the Spina, Kallista and Baccacedlli updates will be useful to me as I continue to convert my setting over so I'll go buy it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"